        openings: ("{D}, a parent, shoved {V}, a coach, against a gym wall after {D}'s child was cut from the team. A gym camera recorded it, and {V} was left with a strained shoulder.", "The defense witnesses will explain that {V} stood in the doorway as {D} was leaving, that {D} was already told to go, and that the shove was a frustrated push, not an attack."),
        closings: ("A parent told to leave, a coach in a doorway, and a shove on camera that left {V} with a strained shoulder. A cut from a team is not a license to put hands on anyone.", "A doorway that was blocked and a parent who pushed to get out. The State must prove this was an assault and not a single frustrated shove."),
