        exam: [.direct("Please tell us about your yard and your neighbor.", "\"I live next to {D}. A limb from my tree fell into {D}'s yard in a storm, and we argued about who should clean it up.\""), .direct("What did you see on {DATE}?", "\"During a dispute over a fallen limb, {D} aimed a loaded bow at {V}. {D} pointed it at {V} and then loosed an arrow into the mulch.\""), .direct("What does the doorbell camera show?", "\"{D} aiming the bow toward {V}. The arrow found in the mulch is in evidence.\""), .direct("Why does that matter?", "\"A loaded bow pointed at a neighbor is frightening. {V} was within feet of it.\""), .direct("What happened on the afternoon in question?", "\"We were shouting over the fence. {D} came out holding a bow with an arrow nocked and pointed it in my direction.\""), .direct("How did you feel?", "\"Terrified. I froze, and then the arrow went into the mulch a few feet from my foot.\""), .cross("{DL} says {D.he} was practicing, doesn't {D.he}?", "\"An archery coach says {D} practices. But the bow was pointed at {V}.\""), .cross("Was {V} hit?", "\"No. The arrow went into the mulch. {V} was lucky.\""), .cross("Did {DL} threaten {V} in words?", "\"There was shouting during the dispute. I don't recall exact words.\""), .cross("Did {D} say anything while aiming?", "\"Nothing I could hear. {D} was angry and breathing hard.\""), .cross("Did you see a target in the yard?", "\"A target stood in {D}'s yard, near the back. I can't say whether {D} was pointing at it.\"")],
        defenseRole: "Archery coach",
